  "text": "High-Quality Vet Hospital in Coral Springs, FL | Veterinary Cancer Health\n4101 Turtle Creek Drive\nCoral Springs, FL 33067\nMon, Tues, Wed & Thurs: 8 AM to 5 PM\nFri: 8 AM to 1 PM\n(954) 369-9688\nVCH@vetcancerhealth.com\n\n\nSchedule an\nappointment\nHome\nAbout\nMeet The Doctor\nHow'd We Do?\nServices\nCancer Diagnosis &\nStaging\nUltrasound\nDigital Radiographs (X-rays)\nCT Scan\nBiopsy & Cytology\nDNA Sequencing & Molecular Analysis\nAdvanced Cancer Diagnostics\nChemotheraphy &\nMedical Treatments\nChemotherapy\nTargeted Therapy\nImmunotherapy\nElectrochemotherapy\nOngoing Cancer\nCare & Monitoring\nRecheck Exams & Bloodwork\nMonitoring Response\nTreatment Plan Adjustments\nMaintenance Therapy\nSecond Opinions &\nCase Reviews\nRecord Review\nCustomized Treatment Plans\nCollaboration with Primary Care Veterinarians\nPalliative Care\nPain Management\nTransition-of-Care Planning\nCompassionate Guidance for saying Goodbye\nFor Pet Owners\nOur Blog\nContact\nSchedule An Appointment\nWELCOME TO\nVeterinary\nCancer\nHealth\nOnline pharmacy\nContact Us\nWELCOME TO\nOnline pharmacy\nContact Us\nYour pet's health is our priority\nDedicated Oncology Care for Dogs and Cats in South Florida\nOur mission at Veterinary Cancer Health is to combine advanced medical knowledge with deep compassion, offering not only expert care, but also unwavering support to the families who love their pets.\nWe focus on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term care of dogs and cats with cancer. Our goal is to extend quality time with your pet while minimizing side effects and maximizing comfort.\n“We know how overwhelming it is to hear that your pet has cancer. Often, the hardest step is simply walking through the door for that first appointment. That’s where we come in, to guide you with knowledge, compassion, and clarity. Together, we’ll navigate this journey and build a treatment plan that offers your pet the best care science and love can provide.”\n— Dr. Francisco Alvarez-Berger, Veterinary Medical Oncologist\nSkillful, Compassionate care\nDr. Francisco J. Alvarez Berger\nDr. Francisco J. Alvarez Berger is a board-certified veterinary medical oncologist with over 20 years of experience dedicated to the care of pets with cancer. He is passionate about providing compassionate, personalized treatment to every pet and family he works with.\nDr. Alvarez Berger completed his oncology residency and a Master’s degree in cancer research at The Ohio State University, where he later served as a Clinical Instructor in the Hematology and Oncology Service. During his time there, he focused on clinical research and teaching veterinary students, interns, and residents in the fields of hematology and oncology.  In 2025, he founded Veterinary Cancer Health, a specialty practice focused on delivering expert, personalized cancer care for dogs and cats. He also serves as an associate professor of veterinary oncology at Universidad Popular Autonoma del Estado de Puebla in Mexico. He is also an active contributor to veterinary oncology through research publications, textbook chapters, and lectures at national and international conferences.\n‍\nMore About\nDr. Francisco Berger\nComprehensive Care, Every Step of the Way\nCancer Diagnosis & Staging\nWe perform comprehensive evaluations to diagnose cancer and determine the best treatment path for your pet.\nLearn More\nChemotherapy & Medical Treatments\nWe provide customized cancer therapy focused on both quantity and quality of life.\nLearn More\nOngoing Cancer Care & Monitoring\nWe monitor your pet closely throughout treatment, adjusting care as needed to manage side effects and maintain the best quality of life.\nLearn More\nSecond Opinions & Case Reviews\nIf your companion pet has received a cancer diagnosis elsewhere, we’re available to review their case, provide a second opinion, and discuss additional treatment options that may be appropriate.\nLearn More\nPalliative Care\nWe help families make informed decisions with compassion, offering pain control, palliative options, and end-of-life support when needed.\nLearn More\nSchedule an appointment\nSUCCESS STORIES\nREVIEWS & TESTIMONIALS\nThe clinic's state-of-the-art facilities and advanced medical equipment further showcased their commitment to delivering top-notch care. Thanks to the expertise and dedication of the entire team, Max made a full recovery, and I couldn't be happier with the outcome. I highly recommend ABC Veterinary Clinic to any pet owner seeking exceptional veterinary care delivered with compassion and expertise.\n- Patient's Name -\nThe clinic's state-of-the-art facilities and advanced medical equipment further showcased their commitment to delivering top-notch care. Thanks to the expertise and dedication of the entire team, Max made a full recovery, and I couldn't be happier with the outcome. I highly recommend ABC Veterinary Clinic to any pet owner seeking exceptional veterinary care delivered with compassion and expertise.\n- Patient's Name -\nAbout Us\nMeet the Team\nHow'd we do?\nServices\nCancer Diagnosis & Staging\nChemotherapy & Medical Treatments\nOngoing Cancer Care & Monitoring\nSecond Opinions & Case Reviews\nPalliative & End of Life Care\nRoutine bloodwork and urinalysis\nRoutine bloodwork and urinalysis\nFlow Cytometry\nFlow Cytometry\nImmunohistochemistry (IHC)\nImmunohistochemistry (IHC)\nPARR\nPARR\nUltrasound\nOngoing Cancer Care & Treatments\nChemotherapy\nChemotherapy\nRecheck Exams & Bloodwork\nRecheck Exams & Bloodwork\nRecord Review\nRecord Review\nPain Management\nPain Management\nDigital Radiographs (X-rays)\nPalliative & End of Life Care\nTargeted Therapy\nTargeted Therapy\nMonitoring Response\nMonitoring Response\nCustomized Treatment Plans\nCustomized Treatment Plans\nTransition-of-Care Planning\nCT Scan\nImmunotherapy\nImmunotherapy\nTreatment Plan Adjustments\nTreatment Plan Adjustments\nCollaboration with Primary Care Veterinarians\nCollaboration with Primary Care Veterinarians\nCompassionate Guidance for saying Goodbye\nElectrochemotherapy\nBiopsy & Cytology\nCancer Diagnosis & Staging\nMaintenance Therapy\nMaintenance Therapy\nDNA Sequencing & Molecular Analysis\nChemotherapy & Medical Treatments\nAdvanced Cancer Diagnostics\nResources\nOur Blog\n\n\n\nAbout Us\nMeet the Team\nHow'd we do?\nServices\nCancer Diagnosis & Staging\nChemotherapy & Medical Treatments\nOngoing Cancer Care & Monitoring\nSecond Opinions & Case Reviews\nPalliative & End of Life Care\nDental Care\nGeneral\nSurgery\nLab Testing\nMonitoring\nCancer Diagnosis & Staging\nChemotherapy & Medical Treatments\nOngoing Cancer Care & Monitoring\nSecond Opinions & Case Reviews\nPalliative & End-of-Life Care\nBiopsy & Cytology\nCancer Diagnosis & Staging\nDNA Sequencing & Molecular Analysis\nChemotherapy & Medical Treatments\nCT Scan\nElectrochemotherapy\nRoutine bloodwork and urinalysis\nRoutine bloodwork and urinalysis\nDigital Radiographs (X-rays)\nPalliative & End of Life Care\nUltrasound\nOngoing Cancer Care & Treatments\nResources\nOur Blog\n\n\n\n©\nVeterinary Cancer Health\nMade with love\n\nVeterinary Marketing\nYour Pet's Wellbeing Matters\nGET IN TOUCH FOR EXPERT CARE\nPHONE\n(954) 369-9688\nADDRESS\n4101 Turtle Creek Drive\nCoral Springs, FL 33067\nEMAIL\nVCH@vetcancerhealth.com\nHOURS\nMon, Tues, Wed & Thurs: 8 AM to 5 PM\nFri: 8 AM to 1 PM\n©\nVeterinary Cancer Health\nMade with love\n\nVeterinary Marketing\nOffice Hours\nOur\nTeam\nContact\nUs\n5.0 ★★★★★\n### reviews\n×\nTell us how we are doing?\nLike\nDislike\nThank You Hooman!!\nCan you please be more specific and leave us a review on your preferred platform.\nLeave a review on\nGoogle →\nLeave a review on\nFacebook →\nLeave a review on\nYelp →\nWhat Can We Improve?\nPlease tell us what we can improve. We love to hear from our clients. Please let us know if there are any areas that you think we could improve upon.\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while s